    "updated_at": "2018-09-12T18:44:48Z",
    "body": "After mulling this over, I wonder if something patterned after the existing document collections could work? \r\nE.g., we have `document.scripts`, `document.links` (which finds all anchors with an href); something like `document.shadowHosts` (which could return all elements with a shadowRoot property that is non-null and open). \r\nThough this would probably not work recursively if that is a necessary use case...",
